Employee Scheduling
Copyright 2024-2026 Mirko Ugolini

This product includes software developed as part of the Timefold Quickstarts
project (https://github.com/TimefoldAI/timefold-quickstarts), specifically the
"employee-scheduling" quickstart, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

This work is a derivative of that quickstart and has been substantially
modified. Changes include, among others: a React/TypeScript front end, a
persistence layer based on Hibernate ORM with support for both SQLite and
PostgreSQL, user authentication and registration, backup and restore, PDF and
e-mail reporting, multi-structure and multi-language support, and Windows and
Linux installers.

